-- Assessment Summary for Unit: comparaison
-- This unit focuses on developing comparison skills through:
-- 1. Mathematical language (plus que, moins que, égal à)
-- 2. Visual and physical representations
-- 3. Ordering and sequencing (croissant/décroissant)
-- 4. Problem-solving with comparisons
-- 5. Integration with arts, storytelling, and real-world applications
-- 6. Progressive complexity from simple comparisons to numbers up to 20
-- 
-- All assessments align with ETFO principles:
-- - Formative focus for ongoing learning
-- - Observable, measurable behaviors
-- - Grade 1 developmentally appropriate
-- - French immersion language requirements
-- - Multiple intelligence considerations
-- - Clear progression of skills and understanding